GitHub Actions quota is exhausted for the month. The production contract was updated for the new module, but Actions were intentionally not triggered. A direct clone/test attempt from the current execution environment was blocked by DNS resolution to github.com, so this PR is reviewed through the exact repository diff rather than claiming an unrun test result.

