The merged R01 scaling contract binds exact component hashes, but it does not yet require proof that the selected MODEL/DATA/TOK/D05/EVAL/TRAIN authorities coexist in one executable candidate tree. In the current large stacked-PR swarm, separately green component heads are not sufficient evidence for a launchable learned-20M candidate.

